{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20784","headline":"叹昨日三首 一 · 卢仝","name":"叹昨日三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨日之日不可追，今日之日须臾期。\n如此如此复如此，壮心死尽生鬓丝。\n秋风落叶客肠断，不办斗酒开愁眉。\n贤名圣行甚辛苦，周公孔子徒自欺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20784.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20784","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}